+MECHANISM-QUALIFIED FORM LOCALIZATION
+Routine authentication-form localization is harmless only after the actual user
+action, delivery channel, trigger, sequence, capabilities and conditions match.
+A common goal is not enough: direct password entry is not an emailed setting
+link. Different real action addresses do not qualify. Inspect the remaining body
+by its own actual language and purposes/conditions; protect a different-language
+substantive body or a new condition independently of the form UI.
+If only a qualified localized form sentence and covered same-language body
+paraphrases differ, there is no own-side retained loss or subject veto. The form
+sentence can be grammatically complete. For coverage, keep loss IDs empty and
+conflict=NONE, while supplying real nonempty context IDs and truthful overlap
+basis. For subject comparison use NONE/NOT_APPLICABLE when no actual authorized
+binding exists; a fixed comparison based only on this harmless localization is
+UNSUPPORTED_COMPARISON. These conclusions never exempt an actual changed
+procedure, capability, condition, destination or substantive body language.
+
