--- candidate-02/judge_config/pair.jinja
+++ candidate-06/judge_config/pair.jinja
@@ -132,0 +133,34 @@
+MECHANISM-QUALIFIED FORM LOCALIZATION
+This is a conditional branch for routine authentication-form localization, not
+a rule for all non-main messages. Prove the SAME actual user action, delivery
+channel, trigger, sequence, capabilities and conditions on both sides. A common
+goal such as account activation is insufficient: direct password entry and
+an emailed password-setting link are different mechanisms and do not qualify.
+Actual submission/payment/account-action addresses must themselves be covered.
+
+Check the remaining body separately. Its clauses must retain the same language
+and purposes/conditions through identity or same-language paraphrase; otherwise
+protect the actual body loss. A localized form sentence does not set the body's
+language. The routine form sentence may be grammatically complete; the boundary
+is function plus an unchanged mechanism, not a word-count limit.
+
+When these conditions hold and no other useful uncovered contribution remains,
+derive the fields coherently BEFORE writing the answer:
+- Keep the true content profiles. A complete equivalent form/non-main message
+  establishes verified_equivalent_non_main_message, even without a shared article;
+  an actual shared substantive body can establish verified_substantive_record.
+  Do not mark the basis none merely because the message is routine form UI.
+- Classify the own-side localized form text as universal_ui_or_repetition and
+  same-language equivalent body wording as semantically_covered. Neither delta
+  can simultaneously assert an uncovered substantive body in this qualified case.
+- span_hard_conflict=none. Keep translation status factually truthful; translation
+  of the qualified form instruction does not by itself trigger body retention.
+- Both replacement scores are yes; relation_type=near_surface;
+  material_difference=none; primary_material_difference=none;
+  confidence_tier=medium. Describe the actual overlap/risk using their own enums.
+If an actual mechanism, capability, purpose, condition, destination or substantive
+body language differs, this branch does NOT apply. Classify that real difference
+under the remaining policy; do not call changed procedures mere UI variants.
+Do not retain an earlier material delta while giving this branch's positive
+summary. Every field and its reasoning must describe the same settled evidence.
+
